CINTA NO. 1
YUSA

145
00:10:38,304 --> 00:10:40,556
<i>Ekspresiku begitu</i>

146
00:10:40,640 --> 00:10:43,142
<i>karena aku tahu perasaan Hinacchi.</i>

147
00:10:43,851 --> 00:10:46,145
<i>Mungkin Kasahara…</i>

148
00:10:48,314 --> 00:10:50,524
Tidak mungkin begitu.

149
00:10:51,192 --> 00:10:52,026
Benarkah?

150
00:10:53,235 --> 00:10:55,112
Baiklah kalau begitu.

