<i>Kak Chinatsu baru pulang tanggal 6.</i>

165
00:11:45,579 --> 00:11:48,666
<i>Meski pergi bermain ski
bersama tim badminton tanggal 4 dan 5,</i>

166
00:11:48,749 --> 00:11:50,084
<i>itu masih empat hari lagi.</i>

167
00:11:52,628 --> 00:11:54,088
<i>Aku sangat merindukannya.</i>

168
00:11:54,171 --> 00:11:55,798
{\an8}BISA KITA BICARA SAAT KAU PULANG?

169
00:11:55,881 --> 00:11:57,091
{\an8}ADA YANG HARUS KUKATAKAN KEPADAMU

170
00:11:59,677 --> 00:12:02,096
<i>Mungkin aku tak mau bertemu dengannya.</i>

171
00:12:02,972 --> 00:12:05,099
<i>Karena saat kami bertemu nanti…</i>

172
00:12:11,105 --> 00:12:12,690
Aku mau pergi lari.

173
00:12:15,151 --> 00:12:18,112
Padahal istirahat beberapa hari saja
tak apa-apa.

174
00:12:18,195 --> 00:12:20,114
Sifatnya memang begitu.

175
00:13:10,331 --> 00:13:12,124
<i>Sampai setahun lalu,</i>

176
00:13:12,750 --> 00:13:15,252
<i>kami hampir tak pernah mengobrol.</i>

177
00:13:17,963 --> 00:13:19,757
<i>Lalu, tiba-tiba saja…</i>

178
00:13:40,903 --> 00:13:44,031
