Kalian berdua bertemu

219
00:17:48,859 --> 00:17:51,737
di tempat kerja Nenek, 'kan?

220
00:17:51,820 --> 00:17:53,947
<i>Benar, di penginapan tradisional.</i>

221
00:17:54,031 --> 00:17:58,494
<i>Kakekmu mengantarkan sayuran tiap pagi.</i>

222
00:17:58,577 --> 00:18:01,580
Kapan Kakek jatuh cinta pada Nenek?

223
00:18:02,790 --> 00:18:06,835
Kakek-kakek zaman sekarang
tidak suka pertanyaan seperti itu.

224
00:18:06,919 --> 00:18:09,379
Cerdik sekali!

225
00:18:10,005 --> 00:18:12,758
Kakek lupa, itu sudah sangat lama.

226
00:18:12,841 --> 00:18:15,969
Kakek malu-malu kalau membahas soal ini.

227
00:18:18,764 --> 00:18:19,932
Chinatsu.

228
00:18:20,474 --> 00:18:22,351
Setelah makan, tolong gali saljunya.

229
00:18:22,434 --> 00:18:23,894
Baik.

230
00:18:26,396 --> 00:18:29,399
{\an8}2 JANUARI

231
00:18:51,004 --> 00:18:52,923
Aku mau jalan-jalan sebentar.

232
00:18:53,507 --> 00:18:55,092
Sekarang masih sangat dingin.

233
00:18:55,175 --> 00:18:58,929
Dia tak suka diam saja di rumah.

234
00:19:12,526 --> 00:19:14,361
Dinginnya.

235
00:19:14,444 --> 00:19:16,822
Seharusnya pakai baju yang lebih hangat.

236
00:19:16,905 --> 00:19:18,198
Benar.

237
00:19:19,449 --> 00:19:21,285
Kau tak apa-apa?

238
00:19:21,368 --> 00:19:22,619
Aku tak bisa kembali lagi.

239
00:19:22,703 --> 00:19:23,954
Jangan sampai sakit.

240
00:19:42,973 --> 00:19:45,142
Lihat saljunya!

241
00:19:47,311 --> 00:19:49,104
Ayo perang bola salju!

242
00:19:50,772 --> 00:19:53,066
- Beri aku sepuluh detik dulu!
- Apa?

243
00:20:20,510 --> 00:20:22,179
Silakan pakai ini jika mau!

244
00:20:26,516 --> 00:20:28,268
Jaga dirimu tetap hangat.

245
00:20:28,852 --> 00:20:30,479
<i>Taiki Inomata.</i>

246
00:20:41,907 --> 00:20:44,868
Kau hebat bisa bangun pagi sekali
setiap hari.

247
00:21:06,890 --> 00:21:08,308
Selamat pagi.

248
00:21:16,858 --> 00:21:18,819
<i>Dia datang lagi hari ini.</i>

249
00:21:19,820 --> 00:21:21,446
<i>Taiki juga datang hari ini.</i>

250
00:21:23,073 --> 00:21:24,241
<i>Hari ini juga.</i>

251
00:21:37,170 --> 00:21:39,006
Chii!

252
00:21:39,089 --> 00:21:40,549
Soal yang kau tanyakan tadi…

253
00:21:41,216 --> 00:21:43,510
Biar Nenek ceritakan sisanya.

254
00:21:43,593 --> 00:21:45,053
Yang kutanyakan tadi?

255
00:21:45,637 --> 00:21:49,224
Ucapan kakekmu
saat dia menyatakan perasaannya.

256
00:21:51,518 --> 00:21:56,189
{\an8}3 JANUARI

257
00:22:05,657 --> 00:22:07,576
Kakekmu sangat malu

258
00:22:07,659 --> 00:22:10,829
saat mengatakan ini kepada Nenek.

259
00:22:14,708 --> 00:22:16,084
<i>"Tanpa kusadari,</i>

260
00:22:17,169 --> 00:22:18,837
<i>ternyata aku</i>

261
00:22:19,504 --> 00:22:22,382
<i>ingin kau menjadi orang pertama
yang kulihat di pagi hari."</i>

262
00:23:48,802 --> 00:23:53,807
{\an8}Terjemahan subtitle oleh Sudirman Lius

